# Curriculum toolbar = Christian’s version

Christian (CJ) is the **source of truth** for Christian Curriculum chrome. Emily / Jeremiah / Alex / Ben M / Noah / Matt (and any other curriculum account) must match him.

## Required toolbar

- Use `#hw-toolbar-bar` + `html.hw-ws-toolbar` (Glass · Cloud pill under the content).
- On Prayer / Situation Cards: `HwStudentToolbar.mountOnHost(...)` via `mountCurriculumToolbar` in `hw-hub-v5-live.js`.
- Keep floating `.hw-mg-widget` / `.hw-hc-launcher` **tucked** (hidden unless popped). Never ship the old corner Glass + corner Cloud + fixed bottom pill as the student UI.

## Do not

- Attach Glass/Cloud only with `HwMagnifyingGlass.attachTo` / `HwHomeworkComments.attachTo` on Prayer/Sit **without** mounting the student toolbar.
- Unmount / `display:none` the toolbar on no-HW / noplan / no-linked-assignment while Prayer or Situation is open (`hw-prayer-toolbar` / `hw-sit-toolbar`).
- Treat “no linked assignment” as “no tools” for curriculum Prayer/Sit — those tabs still need Christian’s pill.

## Smell test

If a curriculum student sees floating Glass (top-right) + Cloud (top-left) and/or a fixed bottom Glass+Cloud pill, you regressed. Remount `mountOnHost` and keep `hw-ws-toolbar` on.
